/// Scenario: a record whose field is itself a Drop-marked record is
/// transitively non-Copy, so the unannotated binding is rejected.
/// Spec: IGN-118 — copy-aware for-of.
@test
function typecheckForOfOverRecordWithDropFieldRequiresRef(): void {
