}

/// A binary right operand is checked expecting the left operand's type, so an
/// unsuffixed literal adopts it.
/// Spec: IGN-132 — expected-type propagation.
@test
function typecheckBinaryRightOperandAdoptsTheLeftOperandType(): void {
